	)
	(text "Matching labels connect electrically. VSYS also supplies the always-on pushbutton controller.\nBQ25895 I2C address = 0x6A. If firmware writes settings, disable its watchdog before host shutdown.\nDefault settings return after complete charger power loss. Keep J104 OPEN until those settings are qualified."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 267.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "593d6773-fca1-4eef-99c7-0745580dd8f3")
	)
	(text "R101/R102 and the external 10k NTC sense temperature.\nAttach the NTC to the cells; connect it at J103.\nAn open sensor inhibits charging."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 232.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "88a47d13-1dc9-4edf-942e-9cb442b0e606")
	)
	(text "J104 OPEN = charging disabled; R105 holds Q101 off.\nFit the shunt only after cell/USB/NTC validation.\nArmed = autonomous charging with the host ON or OFF.\nTP1014 = local QON service access; use TP1001 GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.86 237.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.143 1.143)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8bed0883-7413-418d-9ab0-e18d4251e4bb")
	)
	(text "04  PACK TEMPERATURE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.13 158.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a7ef5a88-5d0b-4399-9025-17c5635fda47")
	)
	(text "J101 receives 5 V from the GCT USB daughterboard.\nJ902 -> two-wire harness -> J101 (same pin numbers).\nSee USB_Input, sheet 10; qualify before charging."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cb49d529-57f6-40dd-a4b2-2d488bf7555d")
	)
	(text "Autonomous defaults: 4.208 V, 2.048 A charge setting.\nFloating D+/D- selects 500 mA input; actual charge\ncurrent falls to match input power. ILIM: 300R (~0.57 A).\nNo charger firmware is implemented; defaults need review."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 281.94 224.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.143 1.143)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d67868d5-3afb-4b35-bdf9-b75c1f9f489a")
	)
