		)
		(uuid "dae41319-5988-4c81-9527-8ed217fbe052")
	)
	(text "J102 = PCB pigtail to the RCY/BEC cable mate.\nRed = protected P+; black = protected P-.\nFMA holder: 2 x 3400 mAh in parallel, 6800 mAh total.\nVerify polarity; no PCB-mounted RCY footprint is implied."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
